<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/3/eng@/~cl_3__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for the proviso to that section the following proviso: \"Provided that— (a) no such refund shall be allowed unless a claim in respect of it is made in the prescribed form within one year after the overpayment or erroneous payment was made; or (b) in the case where any customs duty has been paid under protest under section 13B, no claim of refund shall be allowed unless such claim is made in the prescribed form within one year after the decision on classification or valuation is made known to the claimant.\". New section 1 7A"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/3/eng@> .
